{"3411470": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rogue & Raccoon", "steam_appid": 3411470, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the war against global narcotics cartels, your most valuable ally isn’t another soldier — it’s a <strong>highly trained Red Panda</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The global drug trade has grown into a vast shadow empire spanning dense jungles, hidden laboratories, abandoned villages, and underground trafficking routes. Powerful cartels control these territories, operating far beyond the reach of ordinary law enforcement. To dismantle this network, an elite strike unit deploys an unconventional partner capable of reaching places no human operative can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Small, agile, and intelligent, your <strong>Red Panda infiltration partner</strong> can slip through ventilation shafts, crawl through narrow tunnels, scout enemy camps, and sabotage cartel operations from within. While you engage enemies in intense firefights, your Red Panda opens new paths, gathers critical intelligence, and turns the battlefield in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between <strong>frontline combat and stealth infiltration</strong> as you coordinate with your Red Panda to dismantle cartel strongholds piece by piece.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mission takes you deeper into the narcotics empire—revealing hidden operations, dangerous environments, and the powerful mastermind controlling it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn’t just about firepower.<br>It’s about <strong>strategy, teamwork, and an unexpected ally</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Red Panda Tactical Infiltration</strong><br>Control your trained Red Panda to explore tight spaces, scout enemies, unlock routes, and sabotage cartel infrastructure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense FPS Combat</strong><br>Engage cartel soldiers in fast, responsive gunfights where every bullet counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Enemy AI</strong><br>Enemies patrol, adapt, and coordinate attacks to challenge your tactics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Locations</strong><br>Fight through dense jungles, narcotics labs, abandoned villages, and hidden cartel compounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic Storytelling</strong><br>Uncover the story behind a powerful criminal empire through mission briefings, dialogue, and in-game events.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the war against global narcotics cartels, your most valuable ally isn’t another soldier — it’s a <strong>highly trained Red Panda</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The global drug trade has grown into a vast shadow empire spanning dense jungles, hidden laboratories, abandoned villages, and underground trafficking routes. Powerful cartels control these territories, operating far beyond the reach of ordinary law enforcement. To dismantle this network, an elite strike unit deploys an unconventional partner capable of reaching places no human operative can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Small, agile, and intelligent, your <strong>Red Panda infiltration partner</strong> can slip through ventilation shafts, crawl through narrow tunnels, scout enemy camps, and sabotage cartel operations from within. While you engage enemies in intense firefights, your Red Panda opens new paths, gathers critical intelligence, and turns the battlefield in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between <strong>frontline combat and stealth infiltration</strong> as you coordinate with your Red Panda to dismantle cartel strongholds piece by piece.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mission takes you deeper into the narcotics empire—revealing hidden operations, dangerous environments, and the powerful mastermind controlling it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn’t just about firepower.<br>It’s about <strong>strategy, teamwork, and an unexpected ally</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Red Panda Tactical Infiltration</strong><br>Control your trained Red Panda to explore tight spaces, scout enemies, unlock routes, and sabotage cartel infrastructure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense FPS Combat</strong><br>Engage cartel soldiers in fast, responsive gunfights where every bullet counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Enemy AI</strong><br>Enemies patrol, adapt, and coordinate attacks to challenge your tactics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Locations</strong><br>Fight through dense jungles, narcotics labs, abandoned villages, and hidden cartel compounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic Storytelling</strong><br>Uncover the story behind a powerful criminal empire through mission briefings, dialogue, and in-game events.</p>", "short_description": "Lead an elite strike unit against powerful drug cartels in a tactical FPS. Fight intense battles while coordinating with your trained Red Panda infiltration partner who can scout enemies, access tight spaces, and unlock paths no human can reach.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411470/4db715c96ca105441658bfe6cc39519b7d6f5453/header.jpg?t=1783433721", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411470/588ed7a66b84da492567fbc836b3140d54f9ba86/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783433721", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411470/588ed7a66b84da492567fbc836b3140d54f9ba86/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783433721", "website": "https://bwingsgames.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 and a